## What You'll Build

A fully instrumented Windows endpoint that ships telemetry to Splunk, with working detections for network reconnaissance and content injection attack chains. By the end, you'll have Sysmon talking to Splunk, Event ID 3 firing on every outbound connection, and a detection blueprint for MITRE ATT&CK T1659.

