## Splunk Queries to Build

```spl
# Detect file creation from browser processes
index=main source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
EventCode=11
| where match(Image, "(?i)(chrome|firefox|msedge|iexplore)")

# Detect process spawned from downloaded file location
index=main source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
EventCode=1
| where match(CurrentDirectory, "(?i)(downloads|temp|appdata)")

# Detect network call from suspicious child process
index=main source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
EventCode=3
| where match(ParentImage, "(?i)(winword|excel|acrobat|chrome)")
```

